WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.809
Danny: You big bully!

2
00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:10.113
Tina: Danny, are you okay?

3
00:00:10.114 --> 00:00:12.392
Danny: His hand is so cold.

4
00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:15.217
Brad: Maybe there is no life in him.

5
00:00:15.218 --> 00:00:17.977
This is not good.

6
00:00:17.978 --> 00:00:20.157
Tina: What are we going to do now?

7
00:00:20.158 --> 00:00:28.017
Brad: I think we’re surrounded.

8
00:00:28.018 --> 00:00:30.170
Danny: What’s Bello doing?

9
00:00:30.172 --> 00:00:32.507
Brad: He’s bringing us the art supplies.

10
00:00:32.508 --> 00:00:34.969
Tina: He’ll get captured again!

11
00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:46.826
All three: Bello, no! Stay back!

12
00:00:46.827 --> 00:00:48.759
Bello: He-he!

13
00:00:48.761 --> 00:00:50.853
Danny: Do you see what I see?

14
00:00:50.854 --> 00:00:54.703
Brad: They’re scared of color!

15
00:00:54.704 --> 00:00:58.508
Tina: Good boy, Bello. You saved us.

16
00:00:58.509 --> 00:01:00.321
Bello: Good boy!

17
00:01:00.322 --> 00:01:06.033
Brad: Oh, this is going to be fun.

18
00:01:06.034 --> 00:01:07.648
Danny: Are we ready?

19
00:01:07.649 --> 00:01:09.839
Tina: Ready, willing . .

20
00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.060
. Brad: . . . and

21
00:01:12.061 --> 00:01:18.204
able. Danny: Start your art

22
00:01:18.205 --> 00:01:20.767
project! That’s very artistic, Tina.

23
00:01:20.768 --> 00:01:22.289
Tina: Thank you.

24
00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:33.564
Brad: I think you could get an A from Mr. Smith.

25
00:01:33.565 --> 00:01:36.365
Tina: Look, that one’s going crazy!

26
00:01:36.367 --> 00:01:41.693
Brad: Something’s happening to him!

27
00:01:41.694 --> 00:01:44.502
Danny: The paint melted him into nothing.

28
00:01:44.503 --> 00:01:48.803
Brad: You guys are in big trouble now!

29
00:01:48.804 --> 00:01:55.045
Danny: Hey, bad guy. Catch!

30
00:01:55.047 --> 00:02:00.154
Brad: Danny, watch this!

31
00:02:00.155 --> 00:02:05.797
Tina: Good one, Brad!

32
00:02:05.798 --> 00:02:07.150
Bello: Circles.

33
00:02:07.151 --> 00:02:08.931
Danny: Ready, Tina.

34
00:02:08.932 --> 00:02:16.114
Tina: Ready, aim, fire!

35
00:02:16.115 --> 00:02:18.232
Brad: Right on target.

36
00:02:18.233 --> 00:02:20.704
Danny: Okay. Playtime is over.

37
00:02:20.705 --> 00:02:29.156
Let’s finish them off!

38
00:02:29.157 --> 00:02:31.171
Tina: We did it!

39
00:02:31.172 --> 00:02:32.581
Brad: All right!

40
00:02:32.582 --> 00:02:39.377
Tina: High five!

